. 
. * 政策后逐年处理效应 = 处理单元 - 合成对照
. * 注意：keep 文件尾部有 31 行权重记录（_time 缺失），须先剔除
. use "synth_main.dta", clear

. keep if !missing(_time)
(7 observations deleted)

. rename _time year

. gen effect = _Y_treated - _Y_synthetic

. list year effect if year >= 2014, noobs

